     aaccppiittzz — ACPI thermal zone

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     aaccppiittzz** aatt aaccppii??

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiittzz driver supports ACPI Thermal Zones.  Temperature information
     is available through this driver as a sensor which is updated every 10
     seconds or, if the implementation supports it, via an event.  If the tem‐
     perature exceeds the ‘critical’ temperature threshold, the system will be
     shut down and powered off.  The sensor provided by aaccppiittzz can be moni‐
     tored using sysctl(8) or sensorsd(8).

